  "title": {
    "rendered": "Testimonials &amp; Reviews Policy"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"622\" class=\"elementor elementor-622\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8679fd0 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8679fd0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-87ef982 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"87ef982\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a67fef4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a67fef4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Testimonials &amp; Reviews Policy</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5694dce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5694dce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Use of Testimonials and Reviews</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-10c091c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"10c091c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"25\">We may display testimonials, reviews, case studies, or success stories from clients or customers on <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,\" href=\"https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,/\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">https://lorenmichaelsharris.com,</a> in our marketing materials, or on social media channels.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2569d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e2569d4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Individual Results</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00a131e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"00a131e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-renderer-start-pos=\"312\">Testimonials and examples represent the experiences of particular individuals and are not intended to guarantee that you will achieve the same or similar results. Your outcomes depend on your own efforts, circumstances, and many other factors.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4939395 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4939395\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Authenticity and Editing</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1082b0b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1082b0b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We strive to ensure that testimonials and reviews reflect genuine experiences and opinions. Some testimonials may be edited for grammar, clarity, or length while preserving the original meaning and intent.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-683ac46 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"683ac46\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Compensation or Incentives</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56c5c85 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"56c5c85\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If any individual providing a testimonial has received compensation, discounts, bonuses, or other incentives in exchange for their feedback, we will endeavor to disclose that relationship clearly where the testimonial appears.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63ac5eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"63ac5eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Consent and Removal</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-27ae582 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"27ae582\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Where required, testimonials and reviews are used with the permission of the individual. If you have previously provided a testimonial and would like to update or remove it, please contact us using the information below.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9822436 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9822436\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Contact</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-146c9ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"146c9ec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you have questions about our Testimonials &amp; Reviews Policy or would like to request a change or removal of your testimonial, please contact:<br />• Email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" href=\"mailto:hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">hello@lorenmichaelsharris.com</a><br />• Alternate email: <a class=\"_mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu1r31 _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _syaz14q2 _ect41gqc _1a3b1r31 _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj14q2 _9oik1r31 _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l314q2 _1nrm1r31 _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h16c2 _1053w7te _1ienw7te _n0fxw7te _1vhvg3x0\" title=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" href=\"mailto:lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com\" data-renderer-mark=\"true\" data-is-router-link=\"false\" data-testid=\"link-with-safety\">lorenmichaelsharris@gmail.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c42552 elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form\" data-id=\"9c42552\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"form.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<form class=\"elementor-form\" method=\"post\" name=\"New Form\" aria-label=\"New Form\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"post_id\" value=\"622\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"9c42552\"/>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referer_title\" value=\"Testimonials &amp; Reviews Policy\" />\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"queried_id\" value=\"622\"/>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-form-fields-wrapper elementor-labels-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-radio elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-name elementor-col-100 elementor-field-required\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"form-field-name\" class=\"elementor-field-label elementor-screen-only\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tName\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-subgroup  \"><span class=\"elementor-field-option\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"I understand that my featured guest appearance will be scheduled after my form and guest appearance fee have been completed.\" id=\"form-field-name-0\" name=\"form_fields[name]\" required=\"required\"> <label for=\"form-field-name-0\">I understand that my featured guest appearance will be scheduled after my form and guest appearance fee have been completed.</label></span></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-type-radio elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-group-field_308a6d8 elementor-col-100 elementor-field-required\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"form-field-field_308a6d8\" class=\"elementor-field-label elementor-screen-only\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tName\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-subgroup  \"><span class=\"elementor-field-option\"><input type=\"radio\" value=\"I understand that my episode and related guest content may be promoted across Bathrobe Moments, Loren Michaels Harris  and affiliated platforms.\" id=\"form-field-field_308a6d8-0\" name=\"form_fields[field_308a6d8]\" required=\"required\"> <label for=\"form-field-field_308a6d8-0\">I understand that my episode and related guest content may be promoted across Bathrobe Moments, Loren Michaels Harris  and affiliated platforms.</label></span></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-field-group elementor-column elementor-field-type-submit elementor-col-100 e-form__buttons\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"elementor-button elementor-size-md\" type=\"submit\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0492f11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"0492f11\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
